WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
you heard

2
00:00:03,130 --> 00:00:20,330
Little standard, you are crazy

3
00:00:21,650 --> 00:00:32,900
How is the Night Tail Demon? Surprised or not? Can Jin Chen still stand?

4
00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:36,360
There is indeed something in the Three Sections of the Right Path

5
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:42,380
Even after being injured, you can still stand up quickly.

6
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,660
Transfer the former master

7
00:00:50,290 --> 00:00:51,250
Did you hear that?

8
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:52,690
Our people are coming

9
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,770
Qianfu can't run away today

10
00:00:54,770 --> 00:00:55,930
You can't run away either

11
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:59,540
If something happens, just say that you should have thought of it earlier.

12
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:01,340
But I couldn’t think of anything beforehand

13
00:01:01,540 --> 00:01:02,620
You decent people

14
00:01:02,620 --> 00:01:03,780
not always like this

15
00:01:05,330 --> 00:01:07,490
The third section of the Right Way is still too young after all.

16
00:01:08,550 --> 00:01:16,320
These two guys are crazy. Leave them alone.

17
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,800
The righteous people are rushing in.

18
00:01:17,800 --> 00:01:19,480
Kill first, then leave
